{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04572","headline":"襄州景空寺题融上人兰若 · 张说","name":"襄州景空寺题融上人兰若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高名出汉阴，禅阁跨香岑。\n衆山既围绕，长川复回临。\n云峰晓灵变，风木夜虚吟。\n碧湫龙池满，苍松虎径深。\n旧知青岩意，偏入杳冥心。\n何由侣飞锡，从此脱朝簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}